--- (3a) probe note: my FIRST run of this probe returned [] for both cases ---
That was a PROBE bug, not a code defect, and it is worth recording because it is
the exact misreading a future maintainer will make: selectFixBeforeVerifyTargets
applies isFixKind to the TARGET's own spawnedBy.kind (verdict-contract.mjs:318,
the cycle guard), NOT to the incoming fix's kind. Passing a constant-true
isFixKind therefore excludes every sibling. Corrected to pass the real FIX_KINDS
predicate; the vendored tickets carry no spawnedBy at all (see 4.2b).

